#. module: account_analytic_dynamic_full_cost
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_analytic_dynamic_full_cost.field_account_analytic_plan__full_cost_role
msgid ""
"Productive plans correspond to value-generating activity.\n"
"Reproductive plans correspond to indirect costs to be spread over productive activity.\n"
"Not analyzed plans and their descendants are excluded from full-cost calculations."
msgstr ""
"Los planes productivos corresponden a actividad que genera valor.\n"
"Los planes reproductivos corresponden a costes indirectos que deben repartirse sobre la actividad productiva.\n"
"Los planes no analizados y todos sus descendientes quedan excluidos de los cálculos de coste completo."

#. module: account_analytic_dynamic_full_cost
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_analytic_dynamic_full_cost/models/analytic_plan.py:0
msgid ""
"A productive analytic plan cannot be placed under a reproductive analytic plan.\n"
"\n"
"Plan: %(plan)s\n"
"Parent: %(parent)s"
msgstr ""
"Un plan analítico productivo no puede situarse bajo un plan analítico reproductivo.\n"
"\n"
"Plan: %(plan)s\n"
"Padre: %(parent)s"

#. module: account_analytic_dynamic_full_cost
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_analytic_dynamic_full_cost.field_res_company__full_cost_window_days
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:account_analytic_dynamic_full_cost.field_res_config_settings__full_cost_window_days
msgid ""
"Number of days to look back when computing the full cost multiplier, only used when the method is set to 'Rolling window'.\n"
"\n"
"For example, with 90 days the system will calculate the multiplier based on imputations in the last 90 days before the reference date."
msgstr ""
"Número de días hacia atrás que se tienen en cuenta al calcular el multiplicador de coste completo, solo usado cuando el método es 'Ventana móvil'.\n"
"\n"
"Por ejemplo, con 90 días el sistema calculará el multiplicador según las imputaciones de los últimos 90 días antes de la fecha de referencia."

